  "construction_rules": [
    "Require exact publisher archive and both member hashes before checkpoint deserialization. Retain source configuration and exact V3 guard checks.",
    "Execute the unmodified local upstream explicit diarization/f32 converter with the pinned source/gguf/dependencies; no remote model discovery or installation. Its actual default torch.load uses map_location=cpu,weights_only=False; record deserialization as performed.",
    "Refuse preexisting output; retain exact stdout/stderr/argv/status even on failure. Write no control artifact into production assets.",
    "After construction, inspect every GGUF tensor name/shape/type/byte hash; retain full source-to-output mapping and every skipped/unused checkpoint key. Compare every stored tensor against independently derived expected remap/shape/dtype casts from original source weights, including original F32 bank and F16 convolution exceptions.",
    "Require no missing/unexplained duplicate output names or unaccounted tensors before admitting the artifact for any subsequent numerical inference. This v1 runs no inference or DER scoring."
  ],
  "expected_config": {
    "high_resolution": true,
    "max_num_of_spks": 8,
    "output_subsampling_factor": 1,
    "encoder_layers": 31,
    "encoder_hidden": 512,
    "features": 128,
    "self_attention_model": "rope",
    "subsampling": "feature_stacking",
    "learnable_silence": true,
    "qk_norm": false,
    "attn_mode": "full"
  },
  "precision_scope": "F32-dominant with F16 convolution kernels required by CPU im2col. Upstream nominal file_type0 does not make every tensor F32. Do not call this an all-FP32 oracle.",
  "limitations": [
    "Artifact construction does not establish native model execution, HF/original-NeMo tensor equivalence or a quality fix.",
    "Stored training geometry is not the future inference configuration; any subsequent fixed numerical run must explicitly retain9/4/0/FIFO264/cache264/update222 and correct native10ms/HF cached-prefix/lookahead/valid-frame alignment.",
    "Checkpoint, control GGUF and raw tensor payloads remain outside Git. No published Q8/reference model lock, frozen scorer/protocol/input/output or release gate changes.",
    "No original-NeMo model instantiated. Deserialization and conversion are distinct from neural inference."
  ]
